{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the dark ages of space and take control of one of five Royal Houses vying for dominance in a universe on the brink of collapse. With 28 years of passionate community-driven evolution, Emperor of the Fading Suns returns with new features, modernized gameplay, and immersive visuals designed to expand on the already treasured strategy game as a part of the Enhanced Edition. This classic 4X franchise now looks and plays better than ever on both Steam and Linux!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/843c27b6ed6cff3391e3b1543e4ab778.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span><br><strong>Master Your Domain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the stars and fight for intergalactic dominance on land, air, sea, and space. Battle for control of humanity\u2019s known worlds as one of five Royal Houses and discover new planets while on your quest for the crown. Will you emerge as the supreme ruler of the Known Worlds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/7fc29ce8b891f57e9f911ebef003b0f2.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize combined arms tactics to overcome enemy positions and use the robust diplomacy engine to trade technologies, political offices, threats, favors, and even votes for the imperial crown. Can you lead your noble house, be it selfless Hawkwood, debauched Decados, scheming al-Malik, pious Li Halan, or militant Hazat, and become Emperor of the Fading Suns? The path to victory is up to you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/02642303827d5da8ac57a9b46cced808.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a powerful economic engine that allows you to trade any of the dozens of resources you develop. Engage in diplomacy with the Church, Merchant League, and alien races to expand your reach across the known worlds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/ad4b578afb92e3e2bef83afdd01e07bc.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span>Betrayal, corruption, and shifting alliances await as you navigate the volatile political landscape of a galaxy teetering on the verge of collapse. Watch for the treacherous influence of the Church and the wrath of alien races\u2014your path to power is fraught with uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/77c7e462d4adf74401614e270f11bc6a.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and command powerful forces, including theurgists, psychics, warbeasts, and mutant soldiers. Unleash these mighty legions in devastating combat and reshape the battlefield with your strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/dfabbb028647a5b302e612113e77dfbe.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help evolve the known worlds of <i>Emperor of the Fading Suns</i> as a part of the modding community. With over 28 years of continued support, this community of strategy enthusiasts are well on their path to victory.<strong></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baronett","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/533029eee078bb2b102b9eb9b9976229ad140cd3.jpg"},{"name":"Baroness/Baron","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/e06e4418e21ce38e1ec464e465ae27b1ad112dfd.jpg"},{"name":"Earl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/b3a92976cb2c83a36d92e63dd4f732ab8e74f3c3.jpg"},{"name":"Countess/Count","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/f3bc90b696f4a6fd8b2388afe2675bfde33b8c18.jpg"},{"name":"Duchess/Duke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/0de020a2887e37eef2f0c47f20780ee47bb5ba27.jpg"},{"name":"Lion Rampant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/66b4245d4963f76a0058524bbebffcf4cd8d1939.jpg"},{"name":"Mantis Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/1355f848051ca49755db51158a8d494b924afe59.jpg"},{"name":"Defender of the Faith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/9869a669401b6838e3749bfd80ab6bc014171c12.jpg"},{"name":"Tahir\u2019s Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/b85120c8f8ea95554f82e0bea76c24e204d4f91b.jpg"},{"name":"Estancia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2799350/7f922897a8603b51871544dd7c0688dba06b28ff.jpg"}],"total":68},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2799350?t=1767929691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767929691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/1d37ec83ec48fab01b25d6218e48808df222419d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767929691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/1d37ec83ec48fab01b25d6218e48808df222419d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767929691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2944820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the dark ages of space and take control of one of five Royal Houses vying for dominance in a universe on the brink of collapse. With 28 years of passionate community-driven evolution, Emperor of the Fading Suns returns with new features, modernized gameplay, and immersive visuals designed to expand on the already treasured strategy game as a part of the Enhanced Edition. This classic 4X franchise now looks and plays better than ever on both Steam and Linux!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/843c27b6ed6cff3391e3b1543e4ab778.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span><br><strong>Master Your Domain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the stars and fight for intergalactic dominance on land, air, sea, and space. Battle for control of humanity\u2019s known worlds as one of five Royal Houses and discover new planets while on your quest for the crown. Will you emerge as the supreme ruler of the Known Worlds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/7fc29ce8b891f57e9f911ebef003b0f2.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize combined arms tactics to overcome enemy positions and use the robust diplomacy engine to trade technologies, political offices, threats, favors, and even votes for the imperial crown. Can you lead your noble house, be it selfless Hawkwood, debauched Decados, scheming al-Malik, pious Li Halan, or militant Hazat, and become Emperor of the Fading Suns? The path to victory is up to you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/02642303827d5da8ac57a9b46cced808.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a powerful economic engine that allows you to trade any of the dozens of resources you develop. Engage in diplomacy with the Church, Merchant League, and alien races to expand your reach across the known worlds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/ad4b578afb92e3e2bef83afdd01e07bc.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span>Betrayal, corruption, and shifting alliances await as you navigate the volatile political landscape of a galaxy teetering on the verge of collapse. Watch for the treacherous influence of the Church and the wrath of alien races\u2014your path to power is fraught with uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/77c7e462d4adf74401614e270f11bc6a.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and command powerful forces, including theurgists, psychics, warbeasts, and mutant soldiers. Unleash these mighty legions in devastating combat and reshape the battlefield with your strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/extras/dfabbb028647a5b302e612113e77dfbe.avif?t=1767929691\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help evolve the known worlds of <i>Emperor of the Fading Suns</i> as a part of the modding community. With over 28 years of continued support, this community of strategy enthusiasts are well on their path to victory.<strong></strong></p>","developers":["Holistic Design, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799350/aaabecace1a636ea881674acdd9a395059029236/header.jpg?t=1767929691","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c)2025 Holistic Design, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 23.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799350/663124/55db53dc04927d1705121f430d81825eb5391fca/1750901254/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743770566","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799350/663124/55db53dc04927d1705121f430d81825eb5391fca/1750901254/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743770566","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799350/663124/55db53dc04927d1705121f430d81825eb5391fca/1750901254/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743770566","id":257001423,"name":"EFS_Intro_English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257001423/29966d857700d67fdeb100356bad6bf87f6a9287/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743770566"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799350/662378/09f262a759bd5fc08cd05340e6e100a1b8e46793/1750901254/dash_av1.mpd?t=1712061450","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2799350/662378/09f262a759bd5fc08cd05340e6e100a1b8e46793/1750901254/